{"4212790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DIEATHLON", "steam_appid": 4212790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/7169022401aa6c520faa77f115d2d335.poster.avif?t=1788036603\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/7169022401aa6c520faa77f115d2d335.webm?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/7169022401aa6c520faa77f115d2d335.mp4?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE MOUNTAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold winds break against you. Your expedition leads further into the mountain. Frostbitten fingers grip your shotgun, your only protection. Howls echo across the landscape as monsters pursue, but you are faster. You steady your aim, level your weapon against the beasts, and bring them down. There are many paths, all of them deadly and dangerous, but so are you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a6174907a4bba5dcf3c4557699a78fa5.poster.avif?t=1788036603\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a6174907a4bba5dcf3c4557699a78fa5.webm?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a6174907a4bba5dcf3c4557699a78fa5.mp4?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER HIDDEN PATHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden routes carved deep into the mountain. Fight monstrous leviathans lurking beneath frozen waters. Navigate narrow passageways filled with lethal swarms. Every path leads to unexplored environments, each with their own unique dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a96dc0c40f0c8409946b0ccc993afdb6.poster.avif?t=1788036603\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a96dc0c40f0c8409946b0ccc993afdb6.webm?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a96dc0c40f0c8409946b0ccc993afdb6.mp4?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE A RANGE OF WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of firepower can be found across these snowy peaks. Answer your enemies with the crack of a gatling gun. Cut them down with your break-action shotgun. Lay low the great giants of the mountain and the frenzied masses that litter its slopes. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/7169022401aa6c520faa77f115d2d335.poster.avif?t=1788036603\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/7169022401aa6c520faa77f115d2d335.webm?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/7169022401aa6c520faa77f115d2d335.mp4?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE MOUNTAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold winds break against you. Your expedition leads further into the mountain. Frostbitten fingers grip your shotgun, your only protection. Howls echo across the landscape as monsters pursue, but you are faster. You steady your aim, level your weapon against the beasts, and bring them down. There are many paths, all of them deadly and dangerous, but so are you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a6174907a4bba5dcf3c4557699a78fa5.poster.avif?t=1788036603\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a6174907a4bba5dcf3c4557699a78fa5.webm?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a6174907a4bba5dcf3c4557699a78fa5.mp4?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER HIDDEN PATHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden routes carved deep into the mountain. Fight monstrous leviathans lurking beneath frozen waters. Navigate narrow passageways filled with lethal swarms. Every path leads to unexplored environments, each with their own unique dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a96dc0c40f0c8409946b0ccc993afdb6.poster.avif?t=1788036603\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a96dc0c40f0c8409946b0ccc993afdb6.webm?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/extras/a96dc0c40f0c8409946b0ccc993afdb6.mp4?t=1788036603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE A RANGE OF WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of firepower can be found across these snowy peaks. Answer your enemies with the crack of a gatling gun. Cut them down with your break-action shotgun. Lay low the great giants of the mountain and the frenzied masses that litter its slopes. </p>", "short_description": "Chart a course down dangerous mountain slopes with only your shotgun and your reflexes to keep you alive. Blast through obstacles, fend off deadly monsters, and make split-second decisions. Explore multiple routes, each filled with unique hazards and challenges.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/54dffc14081c8fa5ca2cd4aeb2fc106e70ef69c5/header.jpg?t=1788036603", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/ae4d75b5bbca5a64366e01094286f194c7253048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788036603", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212790/ae4d75b5bbca5a64366e01094286f194c7253048/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788036603", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600 / Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li>